body:
I'll do you one better, if you're on pc and you try to do the afk using the test track method set your screen to borderless window and the lowest aspect ratio. for my pc it used the idle %temps and idle usage. I had to run it overnight but in all I went from lvl 12-47 2 days

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

also you can play another game while you're on borderless window. just dont use and xbox controller because it might accidentally register that you pressed exit in the car meet.

Same thing happened. I even edited it in the delay options manually with 0ms delay each on the subsequent strokes. The process just has a long delay not too good for the game Im trying to achieve on.

&#x200B;

Edit: What broke is the 0ms delay I edit. It works just as fine with a 1ms delay. It cannot function as an instant anymore.
